The '''Book in a Book''' is a location in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Features ==
The '''Book in a Book''' features a few attractions.

=== Entrance ===
The player can access the '''Book in a Book''' by clicking on the bookshelf with particles in {{NPCSprite|Marcia}}'s flower shop at {{Coords|8|72|-15}}. This will open a book, and upon clicking {{Rmt|&2&lLIVE IN THE MOMENT}}, will teleport the player into the '''Book in a Book'''.
{{Book|Time travel is not the/answer to life's/mysteries, as every/moment spent longing/for the past or/yearning for the/future is a moment/lost in the present.//&2&lLIVE IN THE MOMENT}}

=== Montezuma Cat Soul ===
{{Main|Montezuma Pet}}
Located in the center of the '''Book in a Book''', the player can find the seventh [[Montezuma Pet|Montezuma Soul Piece]], which is located at {{Coords|2|63|-17}}. Finding the soul piece will add an additional {{stat|rt|+15}} to the [[Montezuma Pet|Pet]].

